This repository contains extensions derived from PopClip-Extensions
(https://github.com/pilotmoon/PopClip-Extensions), pinned at commit
ea2225b8c4cd9c89411b4b292da753b9fdbbd99d, used under the MIT License reproduced below.

All extensions under extensions/ whose meta.json has "origin": "popclip" (all 367 entries
at this commit: 220 from source/ and 147 from contrib/) are derived from that repository at the
pinned commit. Their files under extensions/<shortcode>/ext/ are byte-for-byte copies of
source/<Folder>.popclipext or contrib/<Folder>.popclipext from the pinned commit; the "upstream" field of each meta.json records the exact path. Authorship
belongs to Nicholas Moore (Pilotmoon) and the contributors of that repository.

Seliq is PopClip-compatible but is not affiliated with or endorsed by PopClip or Pilotmoon.

