  - quiver    (quiver.py: MIT License header)
  - droplr    (droplr.bundle.js: bundled third-party code with BSD-style license notice)
Additionally, 17 extensions credit their authors in the "Credits" field of Config.plist
(houdah-spot, find-any-file, full-half-width, launch-bar, wolfram-alpha, urban-dictionary,
baidu, the-hit-list, phone-amego, get-ip, douban, pub-med, taobao, ecosia, typinator,
snippets-lab, jd); these are kept as-is.

